# Line endings were mixed across the repo — some files CRLF, some LF, decided by
# whichever machine last touched them. That is invisible until a shell script
# gets CRLF, at which point `bash setup.sh` fails on a VPS with an error
# ("\r: command not found") that says nothing about the real cause.
* text=auto

# These are executed on Linux. LF, always, whatever the checkout platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
web-ui/airport-ui.service text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
